"On a Rotten Ladder"
"You are on a rotten ladder.  The wood is wet and slimy and is frayed where

long iron bolts hold it hard against the smooth wall.  Some rust and tarnish

is caked onto the bolts.  A little bit of water trickles down the ladder into

the room below, where the ladder appears to end.  Above is nothing but

darkness and the sound of water dripping.

