comfortably.  The arms are carved from solid rock and are pitted and scarred

from years of moss growth.  Into the back seat of the throne, an image of a

large troll has been carved.  The remains of atattered pillow cling to the

seat.  The throne is clearly old and the rock from which it was carved does

not look native to this area.

