#24753
"The Supply Chamber"
"Torches, nearly burned out, barely illuminate this small alcove from sconces

embedded in the walls.  The walls are build from stones and mortar and hold up

a raised ceiling high above.  Water has gathered in the ridges of the rock and

the corners of the room, leaving dark, damp spots everywhere.  A solid

archway, held up by a lightly-colored keystone, leads south to what appears to

be a throne room.

"
