Everything is damp and spongy in here, from the earth between the cobblestone

floor to the dripping ceiling overhead.  The flickering light of torches

reflects off the iron knobs of the closets.  To the east, there is a high

archway, held up by a lightly-colored keystone, that leads to what appears to

be a throne room.

