#24756
"A Deep Pool"
"This alcove surrounds a small, dark well that is sunken into the floor.  A

circular rim of stones surrounds the lip of the well, with a cobblestone floor

spreading out from the well to the walls.  Waterlogged tapestries depicting

trolls and sorcerers are plastered to the southern wall.  The stones of this

room are all damp from the constant trickle of water that seeps from the pool.

An archway leads north into what appears to be a throne room.

"
